  "$comment": "Single source of truth for the look of every app built on the base platform. 2.0.0 is the readable system in design/REVIEW.md section 2: you read in the body face, you tap and find your place in hand-lettering. Edit here, then run `./base gen`. Never hand-edit the generated files.",
